{"3664020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Dominator", "steam_appid": 3664020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/bf494e6371a90c9a9698a6abb9902024.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/bf494e6371a90c9a9698a6abb9902024.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/bf494e6371a90c9a9698a6abb9902024.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Dominator</strong> is a dark fantasy dungeon management strategy game where you must reclaim your title as a god in a world that dared to forget you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are Illazar. Once a dreaded overlord, cast into the Sphere of Oblivion, and now summoned again by desperate mortals. While kingdoms drown in pointless wars, one ruler has unearthed a mysterious artifact that threatens all living things. The world stands on the brink of annihilation. And only you, an ancient evil, can bring order here. In your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/31cdfa128cbef91d0b71c35240ecb8df.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/31cdfa128cbef91d0b71c35240ecb8df.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget cramped boundaries. Your power reaches as far as your tunnels will carry it. Carve passages through solid rock, uncovering hidden chambers, ancient tombs, and veins of rare resources. Build rooms and upgrade them, shaping your dungeon into a living, perfected organism. Every new hall is more than a space — it’s an instrument of influence: from incubators that breed new creatures to grim altars and torture chambers where prisoners’ wills are remade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/51fe72df8cb2b6e12a39fe6210cef969.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/51fe72df8cb2b6e12a39fe6210cef969.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/51fe72df8cb2b6e12a39fe6210cef969.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/471cefae7fb4fa7a895227a5c8305387.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/471cefae7fb4fa7a895227a5c8305387.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolves, necromancers, witches, flesh-cutters, and demons — your subjects are not mindless drones. They live, feel, fear, and dream. Some grow tired of work, others thirst for blood, and a few may even plot against you. Rule. Punish the disloyal, reward the faithful, force them to breed, train, or torment your enemies. Bend their wretched fates to your will — because every creature knows: its god sees everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/b21540cc22fbd62a58efc75210a8ae4f.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/b21540cc22fbd62a58efc75210a8ae4f.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/b21540cc22fbd62a58efc75210a8ae4f.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/29e7f8de9c617f6ec1f6a281a36ac89c.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/29e7f8de9c617f6ec1f6a281a36ac89c.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your divine hand can do far more than command. Grab, shake, smash, and hurl anything within reach. Want construction to move faster? Slap a worker into action. Humans broke into the corridor? Drop a stalactite on their heads, trigger a bolt-thrower trap — or simply toss in a barrel of explosives. There is no single “right” way — only your will, and tons of interactive environments ready to collapse onto your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/e181555ab77c1860943d323d5facc921.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/e181555ab77c1860943d323d5facc921.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/e181555ab77c1860943d323d5facc921.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0cfe724ab193ae7048ee511ce5500c5.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/f0cfe724ab193ae7048ee511ce5500c5.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will come for your lair. Humans, demons, and creatures of the abyss — everyone wants a piece of your riches. But you are no mere observer. Dive into battle, wield magic, aid your monsters, and turn the battlefield upside down. Make defense a blood-soaked spectacle where your enemies learn one lesson: it’s unwise to anger a god. Intrigue, betrayal, and conspiracy will be your daily bread — because when the true ruler returns, the rules of the game change forever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0753841b7055ed27444dadc81f95e97.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0753841b7055ed27444dadc81f95e97.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0753841b7055ed27444dadc81f95e97.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/bf494e6371a90c9a9698a6abb9902024.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/bf494e6371a90c9a9698a6abb9902024.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/bf494e6371a90c9a9698a6abb9902024.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Dominator</strong> is a dark fantasy dungeon management strategy game where you must reclaim your title as a god in a world that dared to forget you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are Illazar. Once a dreaded overlord, cast into the Sphere of Oblivion, and now summoned again by desperate mortals. While kingdoms drown in pointless wars, one ruler has unearthed a mysterious artifact that threatens all living things. The world stands on the brink of annihilation. And only you, an ancient evil, can bring order here. In your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/31cdfa128cbef91d0b71c35240ecb8df.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/31cdfa128cbef91d0b71c35240ecb8df.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget cramped boundaries. Your power reaches as far as your tunnels will carry it. Carve passages through solid rock, uncovering hidden chambers, ancient tombs, and veins of rare resources. Build rooms and upgrade them, shaping your dungeon into a living, perfected organism. Every new hall is more than a space — it’s an instrument of influence: from incubators that breed new creatures to grim altars and torture chambers where prisoners’ wills are remade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/51fe72df8cb2b6e12a39fe6210cef969.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/51fe72df8cb2b6e12a39fe6210cef969.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/51fe72df8cb2b6e12a39fe6210cef969.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/471cefae7fb4fa7a895227a5c8305387.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/471cefae7fb4fa7a895227a5c8305387.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolves, necromancers, witches, flesh-cutters, and demons — your subjects are not mindless drones. They live, feel, fear, and dream. Some grow tired of work, others thirst for blood, and a few may even plot against you. Rule. Punish the disloyal, reward the faithful, force them to breed, train, or torment your enemies. Bend their wretched fates to your will — because every creature knows: its god sees everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/b21540cc22fbd62a58efc75210a8ae4f.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/b21540cc22fbd62a58efc75210a8ae4f.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/b21540cc22fbd62a58efc75210a8ae4f.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/29e7f8de9c617f6ec1f6a281a36ac89c.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/29e7f8de9c617f6ec1f6a281a36ac89c.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your divine hand can do far more than command. Grab, shake, smash, and hurl anything within reach. Want construction to move faster? Slap a worker into action. Humans broke into the corridor? Drop a stalactite on their heads, trigger a bolt-thrower trap — or simply toss in a barrel of explosives. There is no single “right” way — only your will, and tons of interactive environments ready to collapse onto your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/e181555ab77c1860943d323d5facc921.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/e181555ab77c1860943d323d5facc921.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/e181555ab77c1860943d323d5facc921.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0cfe724ab193ae7048ee511ce5500c5.avif?t=1786147974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras_big/f0cfe724ab193ae7048ee511ce5500c5.webp?t=1786147974 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will come for your lair. Humans, demons, and creatures of the abyss — everyone wants a piece of your riches. But you are no mere observer. Dive into battle, wield magic, aid your monsters, and turn the battlefield upside down. Make defense a blood-soaked spectacle where your enemies learn one lesson: it’s unwise to anger a god. Intrigue, betrayal, and conspiracy will be your daily bread — because when the true ruler returns, the rules of the game change forever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0753841b7055ed27444dadc81f95e97.poster.avif?t=1786147974\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0753841b7055ed27444dadc81f95e97.webm?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/extras/f0753841b7055ed27444dadc81f95e97.mp4?t=1786147974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build and expand your own warm, cozy dungeon where your minions live miserable lives and do their evil things. Take part in thrilling battles against humans, angels, and powerful bosses, defending your domain. Conquer the world by commanding an army with a wave of your hand!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/1294c80783f4b5d79e4e28a9037c76dac8800c7c/header.jpg?t=1786147974", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/a84cc4dad14834063dcceeb53717c633e546dc69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786147974", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664020/a84cc4dad14834063dcceeb53717c633e546dc69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786147974", "website": "https://next-genium.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></l